            <title>Version 1.0.7</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New in 1.0.7</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Fixed: the Lock Screen wallpaper no longer freezes on battery — it now plays at full quality regardless of power, matching Apple's Aerials.</li>
                    <li>New: <strong>Remove from Lock Screen</strong> — clear WallX's wallpaper right from the menu in one tap.</li>
                    <li>Improved lock, unlock, and sleep/wake reliability.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
