        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.5</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New in 1.0.5</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Brand-new control panel — a redesigned menu-bar popover with a Now Playing preview, and grouped Display, Library, and Settings sections.</li>
                    <li>Per-display opacity — set a different brightness for each monitor.</li>
                    <li>First-launch welcome screen to get you started.</li>
                    <li>Under-the-hood rework for a smoother, more reliable experience.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
